// FleetOnce wifi-first-relay-standing human burden row is intentionally absent here —
// std.human_intervention authority is gunbc#7950; this module imports it and authors the burden
// row when that PR merges, not as a fourth fork of the carrier.
data srv1_measured_wireless_note: String = "srv1 fleet controller measured WirelessAdapterAbsent: docker0 enP3p3s0f0 enP3p3s0f1 enP3p5s0 enx62a53617b395 lo tailscale0 veth*, no nmcli wireless interface — so no current fleet host can associate with a DGX OOBE hotspot without a dedicated relay."

